  day: 1
  text: "They \u2018aven\u2019t opened any B-shafts yet? Bloody Nora. You\u2019re
    in a setup, see? Don\u2019t matter where you send me this time. You\u2019re gonna
    fail and we\u2019re getting punished for it. Make sure you perform after this
    \u201Clesson\u201D or you\u2019ll not see the end of the week. You gotta make
    your decisions all careful-like. If you haven\u2019t figured it out yet I\u2019ll
    spell it out for ya, they ain\u2019t telling you nothing. You gotta figure out
    what mine does what. "
